# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). Quest ids, givers, places and levels from
# Polestar's Forever data (data-v2026.11.1: QuestieDB Forever, the 1.60.1 client) and its
# Dungeons codex; Wowhead Forever's zone and quest pages (levels 42-52 on Forever, 5 players;
# Krom's chest and the power stones outside the instance), read on 08/11/2026. Room order and
# fights from the original game's comments: no Forever comment yet, and the Forever dungeon guide
# could not be read (pages blocked). Every quest of the chapter carries a "?". Not played in game.
#
# Optional chapter: asked once in Ironforge at the end of the previous guide (`when group 2240`,
# Prospector Stormpike and Krom Stoutarm); every step here needs that answer (`when done
# uld-start`). Skipped: the whole chapter is left out and the Badlands guide follows.
#
# Flow: Ironforge pickups (previous guide) -> Valley of Fangs (Rigglefuzz, optional) -> the outer
# cave (power stones, Krom's chest) -> Uldaman: Baelog, the Staff of Prehistoria and the hidden
# chamber, Archaedas and the Discs -> Rigglefuzz -> Ironforge rewards.
guide groupe-alliance/20b-uldaman
title Group 18b · Uldaman (dungeon 42-46, optional)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 42-46
zone Badlands
next groupe-alliance/21-terres-ingrates-hinterlands

step Uldaman: before going in
  label uld-start
  when group 2240
  tip Uldaman: a 5-player dungeon at the north end of the Badlands, levels 42 to 52 on Forever: best at 43 or more. This chapter takes its quests, runs the dungeon, then hands everything in. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on in the Badlands.
  note Keep 5 free quest log slots. Everyone takes the quests at their own pace; meet at the entrance for the run.
  accept 2418 optional                    -- Rigglefuzz, Valley of Fangs

step The digsite and the outer cave
  when done uld-start
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves of the digsite in front of the cave and of the outer cave drop both power stones, not often: no need to enter the instance for them. Krom's chest is in the outer cave, at the back of the left-hand hall, behind a pillar, with two guards.
  collect 8009 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- Dentrium Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8052 x8 quest 2418 optional     -- An'Alleum Power Stone: Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8027 quest 1360                 -- Krom Stoutarm's Treasure, from his chest
  goto 44.6,12.1 "Uldaman" r 25

step Baelog and the hidden chamber
  when done uld-start
  tip Baelog, Eric and Olaf wait in the first halls, at the top of a ramp. The chest beside Baelog holds the Gni'kiv Medallion, Revelosh drops the Shaft of Tsol: together they make the Staff of Prehistoria. Plant it in the Map Room, kill Ironaya (elite), then walk all the way into the chamber.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share. A Shattered Necklace may drop on the way: its chain goes on with Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.
  turnin 2398                             -- Baelog
  accept 2240
  complete 2240                           -- Explore the hidden chamber
  accept 2198 item 7666 optional          -- Shattered Necklace, a drop: for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge

step Archaedas and the Discs of Norgannon
  when done uld-start
  tip Archaedas, the last boss, wakes the stone guardians around his room during the fight. Behind him, the Discs of Norgannon: click them, talk to the spirit on the left, then click the Discs again for the miniature copy before you leave.
  accept 2278 object 131474 optional      -- The Discs of Norgannon
  turnin 2278 object 131474 optional
  accept 2279 object 131474 optional

step Rigglefuzz
  when done uld-start
  tip Leave by the front, south to the Valley of Fangs.
  turnin 2418 optional                    -- Rigglefuzz

step Ironforge rewards
  when done uld-start
  zone Ironforge
  tip Fly from Thelsamar. Prospector Stormpike, Krom Stoutarm and High Explorer Magellas are all in the Hall of Explorers; Talvash del Kissel in the Mystic Ward.
  turnin 2240                             -- Prospector Stormpike
  turnin 1360                             -- Krom Stoutarm
  turnin 2279 optional                    -- High Explorer Magellas
  turnin 2198 optional                    -- Talvash del Kissel: his follow-ups need another Uldaman run, not in this guide
  note The Badlands guide next: fly back to Thelsamar and ride south.
